---
// ServiceTimes.astro
// Service times and what-to-expect section.
// Two-column layout on desktop: left (info) + right (service card).
// Background: cream (#F4EFE5).
---

<section id="service-times" class="bg-[#F4EFE5] py-20 md:py-28 px-6 md:px-16 animate-fade-up">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 md:gap-16">
    <!-- Left column: What to expect -->
    <div class="flex-1">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-medium text-[#085CFC] mb-3">
        Plan your visit
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-serif italic text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#111111] mb-6 leading-snug">
        First time? Here&rsquo;s what to expect.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#111111]/70 leading-relaxed mb-5">
        We know walking into a new place can feel intimidating. That&rsquo;s why
        we&rsquo;ve made it easy. From the moment you arrive, someone will greet
        you, help you find a seat, and answer any questions you have.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#111111]/70 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Our services last about 75 minutes and include worship, a message from
        the Bible, and time to connect. There&rsquo;s no pressure to participate
        &mdash; just come as you are.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/visit"
        class="inline-block bg-[#085CFC] text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#0649cc] transition-all duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] btn-press"
      >
        Plan Your Visit
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Right column: Service card + tips -->
    <div class="flex-1">
      <!-- Service card -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-black/[0.08] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8 shadow-[0_2px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-medium text-[#111111]/50 mb-3">
          Sundays
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-serif italic text-3xl text-[#111111] mb-4">
          9:00 AM &amp; 11:00 AM
        </h3>
        <hr class="border-black/[0.08] mb-5" />
        <a
          href="https://maps.google.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-[#085CFC] hover:underline text-sm transition-all duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)]"
        >
          Century City Conference Centre, Cape Town
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Tip items -->
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-black/[0.06] p-6 shadow-[0_2px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
          <p class="font-bold text-[#111111] text-sm mb-1">Arrive 15 minutes early</p>
          <p class="text-[#111111]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            This gives you time to park, grab a coffee, and find a comfortable seat
            before the service begins.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-black/[0.06] p-6 shadow-[0_2px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
          <p class="font-bold text-[#111111] text-sm mb-1">Casual dress code</p>
          <p class="text-[#111111]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Come as you are &mdash; jeans, shorts, or your Sunday best. All are welcome.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-black/[0.06] p-6 shadow-[0_2px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
          <p class="font-bold text-[#111111] text-sm mb-1">Kids are welcome</p>
          <p class="text-[#111111]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We have age-appropriate programmes for children so you can enjoy the
            service worry-free.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
